ok AccessibleName through RTTI
ok AccessibleRole through RTTI
ok AccessibleRole read through RTTI
# names (UIF-1411, UIF-1412)
ok form: its caption, mnemonic removed
ok label: caption; a single & removed, && becomes &
ok AccessibleName wins over the caption
ok panel: caption
ok group box: caption
ok tab sheet: caption
ok tool button: caption
ok tool button without caption: its hint (the short part)
ok image: its hint
ok no source: empty
ok the first associated label in creation order, mnemonic removed
ok AccessibleName wins over the associated label
ok a static text is an associated label too
ok a native control has no provider (UIF-1420)
ok the name of a native control follows the same rules
# HelpText, AutomationId, ClassName, FrameworkId (UIF-1413)
ok HelpText: the hint without the part after |
ok HelpText: a hint without |
ok HelpText: AccessibleDescription wins
ok HelpText: none
ok AutomationId = Name
ok AutomationId of an unnamed control: empty
ok ClassName
ok ClassName of a program class
ok FrameworkId
ok LocalizedControlType: not supplied
ok LocalizedControlType of arCustom: the description
ok a window: focusability from the host
ok a graphic control is not focusable
ok a graphic control has no focus
